<section class="integration-panel card mt-4" id="integration"><div class="card-body"><nav class="integration-tabs" aria-label="Developer tools"><a class="btn btn-outline btn-sm" href="#docs">Documentation</a><a class="btn btn-outline btn-sm" href="#playground">Playground</a></nav><div id="docs"><h2 class="h5">Integrate this application</h2><p class="text-secondary">Authorization code flow with S256 PKCE. Exchange codes on your server. Never put the client secret in frontend code.</p><ol><li>Add your callback in Settings and enable the scopes you need.</li><li>Create a verifier, challenge and random state on your server.</li><li>Send the user to the authorization URL. Verify the returned state.</li><li>Exchange the code once on your server, then call userinfo with the access token.</li></ol><h3 class="h6">Endpoints</h3><pre data-endpoints><%= `GET  ${origin}/oauth/authorize\nPOST ${origin}/oauth/token\nGET  ${origin}/oauth/userinfo\nPOST ${origin}/oauth/revoke\nClient ID: ${dashboard.selectedApp.clientId}` %></pre><h3 class="h6">Server-side token exchange</h3><pre data-token-example><%= `curl -X POST '${origin}/oauth/token' \\
  -H 'Content-Type: application/x-www-form-urlencoded' \\
  --data-urlencode 'grant_type=authorization_code' \\
  --data-urlencode 'client_id=${dashboard.selectedApp.clientId}' \\
  --data-urlencode 'client_secret=YOUR_SERVER_SECRET' \\
  --data-urlencode 'code=RETURNED_CODE' \\
  --data-urlencode 'redirect_uri=YOUR_REGISTERED_CALLBACK' \\
  --data-urlencode 'code_verifier=YOUR_VERIFIER'` %></pre><p class="inline-note">The current server requires a client secret, including when PKCE is used. Keep tokens and secrets on your server. Codes expire after 10 minutes. Redirect URLs must match exactly.</p></div><div id="playground" class="mt-4"><h2 class="h5">OAuth playground</h2><p class="text-secondary">Generate a real authorization request for this app. Opening it shows the consent screen. Granting consent changes this test user's app authorization.</p><form id="playgroundForm" novalidate><div class="form-field"><label for="playRedirect" class="form-label">Registered redirect URL</label><select id="playRedirect" class="form-control" required><% if (!dashboard.selectedApp.redirectUrls?.length) { %><option value="">Add a redirect URL in Settings first</option><% } (dashboard.selectedApp.redirectUrls || []).forEach(url => { %><option value="<%= url %>"><%= url %></option><% }) %></select></div><fieldset class="mb-3"><legend class="h6">Requested scopes</legend><div id="playScopes" class="d-flex flex-wrap gap-3"><% (dashboard.selectedApp.scopes || []).forEach(scope => { %><label class="d-flex gap-2 align-items-center"><input type="checkbox" class="check" value="<%= scope %>" checked><%= scope %></label><% }) %></div></fieldset><button type="submit" class="btn theme-brand btn-solid btn-sm">Generate request</button><p id="playError" class="field-error" role="alert" hidden></p></form><div id="playResult" hidden class="mt-3"><label class="form-label" for="playUrl">Authorization URL</label><textarea id="playUrl" class="form-control mono" rows="5" readonly></textarea><a id="playOpen" class="btn btn-outline btn-sm mt-3" target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer">Open consent screen <i class="fa-solid fa-arrow-up-right-from-square" aria-hidden="true"></i></a><details class="mt-3"><summary>PKCE verifier for this test</summary><p class="form-text">Only use for this request. Kept in this page's memory, not saved to local storage. Reloading discards it.</p><pre id="playVerifier"></pre></details><div class="form-field mt-3"><label class="form-label" for="playCallback">Returned callback URL</label><input id="playCallback" class="form-control" type="url" placeholder="Paste the callback URL after consent"><button id="playInspect" type="button" class="btn btn-outline btn-sm mt-2">Validate callback</button><p id="playCallbackStatus" role="status" class="form-text mt-2"></p></div></div><details class="mt-4"><summary>Test userinfo</summary><p class="form-text">Use a test access token from your server-side exchange. This request goes only to this Auth server. It is not saved.</p><form id="userinfoForm" class="mt-3"><label class="form-label" for="playAccessToken">Test access token</label><input id="playAccessToken" class="form-control" type="password" required autocomplete="off"><button class="btn btn-outline btn-sm mt-3" type="submit">GET /oauth/userinfo</button></form><pre id="playUserinfo" class="mt-3" aria-live="polite"></pre></details></div></div></section>